WEBVTT

00:53:58.640 --> 00:54:01.004
CA: One thing I find
super hopeful about that

00:54:01.028 --> 00:54:06.575
is that the scale of jobs in that space
can actually massively increase.

00:54:06.599 --> 00:54:08.853
Sometimes, the discussion
about future jobs

00:54:08.877 --> 00:54:11.537
implies that there's just
an ever-dwindling number.

00:54:11.561 --> 00:54:13.172
But by looking at the sector,

00:54:13.196 --> 00:54:15.601
looking at how many
lonely people there are

00:54:15.625 --> 00:54:16.783
in old-age homes,

00:54:16.807 --> 00:54:19.210
how many areas where, in principle,

00:54:19.234 --> 00:54:26.001
society could pay someone to combine
human values, service values,

00:54:26.025 --> 00:54:27.203
empathy values,

00:54:27.227 --> 00:54:29.458
with assistive intelligence.

00:54:29.482 --> 00:54:31.839
That was actually quite hopeful.